#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_select
#! frames  260
#! poster  150
#! keys
# click block 3, shift+click block 8: 3 to 8; ctrl+click block 11 (added) and block 5 (removed); Freeze marks them;
# back in the list (ctrl+click block 1), ctrl+a selects all 2000; escape clears
0   move 300 300
5   move 80 93 15
25  down
27  up
45  move 80 188 15
60  key shift down
62  down
64  up
66  key shift up
85  move 80 245 15
100 key ctrl down
102 down
104 up
106 key ctrl up
115 move 80 131 10
125 key ctrl down
127 down
129 up
131 key ctrl up
150 move 38 415 15
170 down
172 up
180 move 80 55 10
188 key ctrl down
190 down
192 up
194 key ctrl up
205 key shortcut down
207 key a
209 key shortcut up
235 key escape
